### negated grep after a pipe
#!/bin/sh
ls /etc | ! grep -q passwd
>>- SC2012 2:1 -- mvdan.cc/sh rejects ! after a pipe, so there is no tree to inspect
>>> SC2326 2:11

### negation inside subshell stage is fine
#!/bin/sh
ls /etc | ( ! grep -q passwd )
>>> SC2012 2:1

### leading bangs negate the whole pipeline
#!/bin/sh
! ! ls /etc | grep -q passwd
>>- SC2010 2:5 -- mvdan.cc/sh rejects a doubled !, so there is no tree to inspect
>>> SC2325 2:1
